menu "Micro OS filesystems"

    config MICRO_OS_FS_FAT32
        bool "FAT12/16/32, read-only"
        default n
        help
            Read the volume of a card or a disk that another system wrote.
            The filesystem has no modes, no owners and no time of its own,
            and it never writes: the board keeps its root on MicroFS, and
            this reader is for the medium a person brings.

endmenu
